    {
      "name": "axe_culling_blade",
      "id": 5010,
      "name_zh": "淘汰之刃",
      "name_en": "Culling Blade",
      "description_zh": "斧王洞察到弱点并出击，造成纯粹伤害。淘汰之刃击杀敌方英雄时将重置冷却时间，而附近所有友军单位获得移动速度和护甲加成。\n\n每当斧王通过淘汰之刃击杀敌方英雄，他的战刃就会浸满鲜血，获得永久叠加效果，每层都会提供护甲加成。",
      "description_en": "Axe spots a weakness and strikes, dealing pure damage. When an enemy hero is killed with Culling Blade, its cooldown is reset, and all nearby allied units gain bonus movement speed and armor.\n\nAxe permanently drenches his blade every time he kills an enemy Hero with Culling Blade, gaining bonus armor for each stack.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "淘汰之刃的斩杀效果无法被薄葬等技能阻止。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "Culling Blade death cannot be prevented with other abilities like Shallow Grave."
      ],
